    <section id="faq" class="faq">

      <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">

        <header class="section-header">
          <h2>F.A.Q</h2>
          <p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>
        </header>

        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <!-- F.A.Q List 1-->
            <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="faqlist1">
              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq-content-1">
                    Do i have to use WhatsApp Business account?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq-content-1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist1">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    You don't need to; you may also use standard WhatsApp. However, WhatsApp Business imparts a
                    professional impression on the user.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq-content-2">
                    Can i send audio, video, or documents?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq-content-2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist1">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    The available endpoints support text and several media types, including images, audio, video, and
                    documents. Exact options depend on the endpoint.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq-content-3">
                    Are message delivery and volume unlimited?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq-content-3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist1">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    No. Delivery and usage are subject to WhatsApp policies, account limits, recipient availability,
                    and network conditions. Avoid unsolicited or high-volume messaging.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq-content-4">
                    How should I message customers responsibly?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq-content-4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist1">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    Message customers who have agreed to hear from you, identify your business clearly, and respect
                    opt-out requests. WhatsApp may apply account-specific limits; this service cannot guarantee
                    delivery or prevent account restrictions.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-6">

            <!-- F.A.Q List 2-->
            <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="faqlist2">

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq2-content-1">
                    What should I pay close attention to?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq2-content-1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist2">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    Use it only for appropriate, consent-based communication and follow WhatsApp's terms and policies.
                    Do not send spam or unsolicited bulk messages. Account restrictions and delivery outcomes are
                    controlled by WhatsApp.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq2-content-2">
                    Is this the official WhatsApp Business Platform API?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq2-content-2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist2">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    No. This service connects through a linked WhatsApp Web session using Baileys; it is not the
                    official WhatsApp Business Platform (Cloud API). Review WhatsApp's terms and assess whether this
                    integration is appropriate for your business before using it.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq2-content-3">
                    Can I use the same account in WhatsApp Web?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq2-content-3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist2">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    This service uses a linked WhatsApp Web session. Use of other linked devices depends on WhatsApp's
                    current multi-device behavior and the state of your account.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#faq2-content-4">
                    Can my WhatsApp number be banned?
                  </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq2-content-4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqlist2">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    WhatsApp may restrict accounts for policy violations or patterns recipients report as spam.
                    Send relevant messages only to opted-in customers, keep volume appropriate, and follow WhatsApp's
                    terms. No integration can guarantee an account will never be restricted.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section><!-- End F.A.Q Section -->


